---
args: {"folders": "EvidencePage[]", "prior": "ExpenseCaseFile"}
returns: "string[]"
---
Compare source IDs, versions and factual contents to the evidence supporting the previous decision and requests. Record an amended receipt or newly authorized exception as new only with its actual issuer/version. Repeated wording, a renamed file, or resubmitting a rejected receipt is not independent evidence. Preserve a changed fact's original and revised values so the reviewer can see why reconsideration is justified.
